{"seq":3,"slug":"combat-model","title":"战斗模型：动作状态机与帧时间轴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/foundations/combat-model","wordCount":1508,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"战斗模型-动作状态机与帧时间轴\">战斗模型：动作状态机与帧时间轴</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>战斗模型指的是用一台<strong>动作状态机</strong>（任意时刻角色恰好处于一个明确的动作状态）来表示&quot;角色此刻在干什么&quot;，并在每个攻击状态内部挂上一条<strong>帧时间轴</strong>（起手/判定/收招三段）。它是全 hub 的坐标系：判定、连招、受击三章都挂在这根主干上，各篇讲的几乎都是&quot;这台状态机的某一段如何实现&quot;。</p>\n<p>近战系统里最容易被低估、又最能带来秩序的一个决定，是用什么数据结构来表示&quot;角色此刻在干什么&quot;。用一堆布尔量拼状态会指数级爆炸，而用一台<strong>动作状态机</strong>——任意时刻角色恰好处于一个明确的动作状态——则能让判定、连招、受击三章都挂在同一根主干上。本篇建立这根主干：动作状态机的形态，以及每个攻击状态内部的帧时间轴。这套抽象是全 hub 的坐标系，后面各篇讲的几乎都是&quot;这台状态机的某一段如何实现&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动作状态机而非布尔标志\">动作状态机而非布尔标志</h2><p>核心原则是<strong>互斥的单一状态</strong>。角色在任一帧只能处于 Idle、Walk、Startup、Active、Recovery、HitStun、Block 等状态之一，状态之间由明确的转移条件连接。这样&quot;能不能在此刻做某事&quot;就变成&quot;当前状态是否允许转移到目标状态&quot;，而不是去检查一串可能互相矛盾的标志位。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Idle[待机/移动] --&gt;|按攻击键| Startup[起手]&#10;    Startup --&gt;|起手帧走完| Active[判定]&#10;    Active --&gt;|判定帧走完| Recovery[收招]&#10;    Recovery --&gt;|收招走完| Idle&#10;    Active --&gt;|取消窗口内再输入| Startup&#10;    Recovery --&gt;|取消窗口内再输入| Startup&#10;    Idle --&gt;|被命中| HitStun[受击硬直]&#10;    Active --&gt;|被命中| HitStun&#10;    Startup --&gt;|被命中| HitStun&#10;    HitStun --&gt;|硬直结束| Idle&#10;    Idle --&gt;|按防御| Block[防御]&#10;    Block --&gt;|松开| Idle\">graph TD\n    Idle[待机/移动] --&gt;|按攻击键| Startup[起手]\n    Startup --&gt;|起手帧走完| Active[判定]\n    Active --&gt;|判定帧走完| Recovery[收招]\n    Recovery --&gt;|收招走完| Idle\n    Active --&gt;|取消窗口内再输入| Startup\n    Recovery --&gt;|取消窗口内再输入| Startup\n    Idle --&gt;|被命中| HitStun[受击硬直]\n    Active --&gt;|被命中| HitStun\n    Startup --&gt;|被命中| HitStun\n    HitStun --&gt;|硬直结束| Idle\n    Idle --&gt;|按防御| Block[防御]\n    Block --&gt;|松开| Idle</pre><p>这张图是本 hub 后续内容的目录：<code>Startup→Active→Recovery</code> 三段是判定章的舞台；<code>Active/Recovery</code> 到 <code>Startup</code> 的取消边是连招章的核心（见 <a href=\"../flow/cancels-buffering\">取消与输入缓冲</a>）；进入 <code>HitStun</code> 的三条边是实践章受击反应的入口（见 <a href=\"../practice/enemy-reactions\">敌人受击反应</a>）。动画层通常镜像这台状态机，但二者应当解耦——状态机是逻辑真相，动画只是它的一种表现，这一点与 <a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/playback-blending/state-machines\">动画系统 · 状态机</a> 里的动画状态机是两层不同的东西，不要混为一谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"攻击状态的三段时间轴\">攻击状态的三段时间轴</h2><p>每个攻击状态内部是一条离散的帧时间轴，经典地分为三段：起手（startup）、判定（active）、收招（recovery）。一次攻击的总时长就是三者之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>startup</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>recovery</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}} = f_{\\text{startup}} + f_{\\text{active}} + f_{\\text{recovery}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">startup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recovery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>起手段角色在&quot;抬手&quot;，此时攻击框尚未激活；判定段攻击框开启、能造成命中；收招段&quot;收刀&quot;，无法命中且通常无法自由行动。玩家读到的&quot;快慢&quot;主要看起手，&quot;能否连招&quot;主要看收招能否被取消。</p>\n<p>举一个具体的中段拳，总时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}} = 8 + 3 + 14 = 25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span> 帧，在 60fps 下约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>417</mn><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">417\\ \\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">417</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>帧范围</th>\n<th>攻击框</th>\n<th>可取消</th>\n<th>玩家感知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起手 startup</td>\n<td>1–8</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>招式的&quot;快慢&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定 active</td>\n<td>9–11</td>\n<td>开启</td>\n<td>命中时可特殊取消</td>\n<td>能否打中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收招 recovery</td>\n<td>12–25</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>命中后部分可取消</td>\n<td>能否接下一招</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判定段的具体几何、扫掠与多段规则不在本篇展开，是判定章 <a href=\"../hitreg/active-frames\">起手/判定/收招帧</a> 与 <a href=\"../hitreg/hit-detection\">命中检测</a> 的主题；本篇只确立&quot;每个攻击状态由这条时间轴组织&quot;这个共识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"帧数据-驱动状态机的数据表\">帧数据：驱动状态机的数据表</h2><p>状态机的形态是静态的，真正让不同招式手感各异的是挂在每个状态上的<strong>帧数据</strong>。帧数据把一招的所有时序与效果参数收敛成一行可编辑的数据，这样策划调整不必碰代码。一行典型的近战帧数据大致是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时序：起手帧、判定帧、收招帧、命中/被防御时的帧优势</li>\n<li>效果：伤害、削韧、命中硬直、被防御硬直、击退向量</li>\n<li>判定：攻击框列表（几何、偏移、激活帧区间）</li>\n<li>连招：可取消到哪些状态、取消窗口</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这些做成数据表是&quot;手感可调&quot;的前提，具体的表结构与调参流程见 <a href=\"../practice/melee-tuning\">手感调校</a>。这里要强调的是设计原则：<strong>逻辑帧驱动，而非动画时长驱动</strong>。判定和状态转移应当以固定步长的逻辑帧为准，动画只是被这条时间轴驱动的表现层；否则动画一改，判定就漂移，也无法在回滚网络里保持确定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"固定步长与确定性\">固定步长与确定性</h2><p>近战判定几乎总是跑在固定步长的逻辑更新里，典型是每秒 60 逻辑帧。原因有二。其一是<strong>可复现</strong>：帧数据以整数帧计量，只有固定步长才能保证&quot;起手第 8 帧&quot;在每台机器、每次运行都指同一时刻。其二是<strong>网络一致性</strong>：回滚（rollback）与预测同步要求战斗逻辑是确定性的纯函数——给定相同输入序列，任意机器算出完全相同的判定结果。这就要求判定逻辑不依赖可变帧率、不读浮点渲染时间、不掺入随机来源。渲染可以插值到任意刷新率，但逻辑帧必须离散且固定。这条约束如何影响落地实现，见 <a href=\"../practice/melee-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>用互斥的单一动作状态机取代布尔标志，&quot;能否做某事&quot;变成&quot;当前状态是否允许转移&quot;。</li>\n<li>状态机是全 hub 的坐标系：三段时间轴是判定章舞台，取消边是连招章核心，HitStun 边是受击反应入口。</li>\n<li>每个攻击状态内部是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>startup</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>recovery</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{total}} = f_{\\text{startup}} + f_{\\text{active}} + f_{\\text{recovery}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">startup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recovery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的离散帧时间轴。</li>\n<li>招式的性格由挂在状态上的帧数据表决定，做成可编辑数据是&quot;手感可调&quot;的前提。</li>\n<li>判定必须逻辑帧驱动而非动画驱动，并跑在固定步长里以保证可复现与网络确定性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<l